      {"w":"a stopgap measure","t":"idiom","m":"giải pháp tạm thời","u":"be + a stopgap measure","x":"The subsidy was a stopgap measure that lasted nine years.","x2":"Keeping the old plant open is a stopgap measure."},
      {"w":"bite the bullet","t":"idiom","m":"cắn răng chấp nhận","u":"bite the bullet","x":"They bit the bullet and replaced the whole system.","x2":"The council bit the bullet and borrowed."}
