      {"w":"say one's piece","t":"idiom","m":"nói hết ý mình","u":"say one's piece","x":"She said her piece and left.","x2":"Everyone was allowed to say their piece first."},
      {"w":"have a word with","t":"idiom","m":"nói riêng một chút với","u":"have a word with + sb","x":"He had a word with the supervisor and the shift changed.","x2":"She had a quiet word with both of them."},
      {"w":"in plain English","t":"idiom","m":"nói nôm na là","u":"in plain English","x":"In plain English, the service is closing.","x2":"The guidance was rewritten in plain English."},
      {"w":"take at face value","t":"idiom","m":"tin theo bề ngoài","u":"take + N + at face value","x":"They took the statement at face value and were disappointed.","x2":"She takes nothing at face value now."}
