      {"w":"make a fresh start","t":"idiom","m":"bắt đầu lại từ đầu","u":"make a fresh start","x":"They made a fresh start nine hundred kilometres away.","x2":"She made a fresh start at fifty with two suitcases."},
      {"w":"start a new life","t":"idiom","m":"bắt đầu cuộc sống mới","u":"start a new life","x":"They started a new life in a language they did not speak.","x2":"He started a new life twice in one decade."},
      {"w":"a place in the sun","t":"idiom","m":"chỗ ở nơi nắng ấm","u":"look for + a place in the sun","x":"Retirement meant a place in the sun for exactly nine months.","x2":"They sold up and looked for a place in the sun."},
      {"w":"the land of one's birth","t":"idiom","m":"quê hương nơi sinh ra","u":"the land of one's birth","x":"She returned to the land of her birth at eighty.","x2":"The land of his birth existed under another name by then."},
      {"w":"live to a ripe old age","t":"idiom","m":"sống đến tuổi đại thọ","u":"live to a ripe old age","x":"Both grandparents lived to a ripe old age in the same village.","x2":"He lived to a ripe old age on bread and work."},
      {"w":"a close-knit community","t":"idiom","m":"cộng đồng gắn bó khăng khít","u":"be + a close-knit community","x":"It was a close-knit community and hard to join.","x2":"A close-knit community notices an absence within a day."}
